# The Forbidden Frontier (abyssea 166), the partial: a level 99 Warrior in Port Jeuno with A Journey Begins completed
# and the quest accepted (GMs). Each pair of its three maw quests completed with the third missing (A Goldstruck Gigas
# missing, To Paste a Peiste missing, Megadrile Menace missing): the completion section needs all three, so Joachim
# offers nothing each time.
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onEventFinish/332
char zone=PortJeuno pos=-51.344,0,-9.978 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.TheForbiddenFrontier accepted
quest Abyssea.ToPasteAPeiste completed
quest Abyssea.MegadrileMenace completed
login
trigger Joachim                         # A Goldstruck Gigas missing: nothing
finish-if-event
quest Abyssea.ToPasteAPeiste available
quest Abyssea.AGoldstruckGigas completed
trigger Joachim                         # To Paste a Peiste missing: nothing
finish-if-event
quest Abyssea.MegadrileMenace available
quest Abyssea.ToPasteAPeiste completed
trigger Joachim                         # Megadrile Menace missing: nothing
finish-if-event
